WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.434
-Welcome back, everybody.
We're hanging out with

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.133
three-time Grammy-winning
music superstar,

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:07.133
