Whoo!

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.767
-Is everyone okay?

00:09:37.767 --> 00:09:39.567
-You didn't do it good.
-Yes, I did.

00:09:39.567 --> 00:09:41.801
-No, you didn't.
Let's make a mess.

00:09:43.634 --> 00:09:45.267
Make a mess.
-What do you mean?

00:09:45.267 --> 00:09:47.300
-You have to -- You should have
made a mess like this.

00:09:49.334 --> 00:09:54.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:54.534 --> 00:09:56.701
-Congratulations
on the new album.

00:09:58.634 --> 00:10:01.567
"Traumazine" is officially out
now.

00:10:01.567 --> 00:10:03.801
Natalia Dyer joins us
after the break.

00:10:03.801 --> 00:10:05.734
Stick around, cheers.
Congratulations.

00:10:05.734 --> 00:10:08.033
Dude, you are the greatest.
Come on!

